{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-driven-development","title":"可观测性驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/foundations/observability-driven-development","wordCount":1401,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性驱动开发\">可观测性驱动开发</h1><p>传统做法是代码写完后补监控——&quot;feature done, add metrics later&quot;。可观测性驱动开发（Observability-Driven Development, ODD）反转了这个顺序：在写业务逻辑之前，先定义&quot;这个功能上线后我怎么知道它是否正常工作&quot;。这不是测试驱动开发（TDD）的替代品，而是补充——TDD 验证代码逻辑正确性，ODD 验证代码在生产环境中的行为可见性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ODD 的核心概念是一份在编码前就确定的“可观测性契约”，它把“可观测”从运维职责前移为设计产物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在 ODD 中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可观测性契约</td>\n<td>设计阶段约定的“正常/异常/定位维度”</td>\n<td>ODD 的第一步产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span 骨架</td>\n<td>业务逻辑实现前先定义的 trace 结构</td>\n<td>代码的“可观测接口”</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLI</td>\n<td>用户视角的服务质量比率</td>\n<td>契约的量化表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信噪比</td>\n<td>排障时实际用到的 span/attribute 占比</td>\n<td>反模式“过度插桩”的度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>feature_flag.variant</td>\n<td>span 上标记灰度变体</td>\n<td>新旧实现对比的数据基础</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ODD 与 TDD 是互补而非替代：TDD 验证代码逻辑正确性，ODD 验证代码在生产环境中的行为可见性——两者都在编码前发生，但关注不同维度的“正确”。</p>\n<h2 id=\"odd-与相邻实践的关系\">ODD 与相邻实践的关系</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 开发循环&#10;        TDD[TDD&lt;br/&gt;逻辑正确性] --&gt; ODD[ODD&lt;br/&gt;生产可见性]&#10;        ODD --&gt; SLO[SLO&lt;br/&gt;用户体验承诺]&#10;    end&#10;    ODD --&gt;|定义 SLI| SLO&#10;    SLO --&gt;|驱动告警| A[Alert]&#10;    A --&gt;|反馈| TDD\">graph TB\n    subgraph 开发循环\n        TDD[TDD&lt;br/&gt;逻辑正确性] --&gt; ODD[ODD&lt;br/&gt;生产可见性]\n        ODD --&gt; SLO[SLO&lt;br/&gt;用户体验承诺]\n    end\n    ODD --&gt;|定义 SLI| SLO\n    SLO --&gt;|驱动告警| A[Alert]\n    A --&gt;|反馈| TDD</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>产出物</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TDD</td>\n<td>这段代码是否按预期工作？</td>\n<td>单元/集成测试</td>\n<td>编码前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ODD</td>\n<td>这段代码上线后能否被观测？</td>\n<td>Span 设计、Metric 定义、Dashboard</td>\n<td>设计阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLO</td>\n<td>用户对这个功能的体验标准是什么？</td>\n<td>SLI 定义 + 错误预算策略</td>\n<td>需求阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"odd-的四步流程\">ODD 的四步流程</h2><h3 id=\"第一步-定义可观测性契约\">第一步：定义可观测性契约</h3><p>在写代码之前，回答以下问题并写入设计文档：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>这个功能的&quot;正常&quot;是什么样子？</strong> 用 SLI 语言描述——如&quot;99% 的支付请求在 2 秒内完成且返回 2xx&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>当它不正常时，我怎么发现？</strong> 定义告警条件——如&quot;5 分钟内错误率 &gt; 1%&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>发现后我怎么定位？</strong> 需要哪些维度——如 <code>payment.provider</code>、<code>payment.method</code>、<code>user.tier</code></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"第二步-先写-span-骨架\">第二步：先写 Span 骨架</h3><p>在实现业务逻辑之前，先定义 trace 的结构。这类似于 TDD 中&quot;先写测试&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function processPayment(order: Order): Promise&lt;PaymentResult&gt; {&#10;  return tracer.startActiveSpan(&#10;    &#39;payment.process&#39;,&#10;    {&#10;      attributes: {&#10;        &#39;payment.provider&#39;: order.provider,&#10;        &#39;payment.method&#39;: order.method,&#10;        &#39;payment.amount&#39;: order.amount,&#10;        &#39;order.id&#39;: order.id,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;    async (span) =&gt; {&#10;      try {&#10;        // 业务逻辑待实现&#10;        const result = await executePayment(order);&#10;        span.setAttributes({&#10;          &#39;payment.transaction_id&#39;: result.transactionId,&#10;          &#39;payment.status&#39;: result.status,&#10;        });&#10;        return result;&#10;      } catch (error) {&#10;        span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.ERROR, message: error.message });&#10;        span.recordException(error);&#10;        throw error;&#10;      } finally {&#10;        span.end();&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startActiveSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'payment.process'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      attributes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'payment.provider'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: order.provider,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'payment.method'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: order.method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'payment.amount'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: order.amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'order.id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: order.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 业务逻辑待实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> executePayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          'payment.transaction_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: result.transactionId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          'payment.status'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: result.status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, message: error.message });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">recordException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"第三步-定义-metric-与-dashboard\">第三步：定义 Metric 与 Dashboard</h3><p>基于第一步的契约，定义需要的指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const paymentDuration = meter.createHistogram(&#39;payment.duration&#39;, {&#10;  description: &#39;Payment processing duration&#39;,&#10;  unit: &#39;ms&#39;,&#10;  advice: { explicitBucketBoundaries: [50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2000, 5000] },&#10;});&#10;&#10;const paymentErrors = meter.createCounter(&#39;payment.errors&#39;, {&#10;  description: &#39;Payment error count&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paymentDuration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createHistogram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment.duration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Payment processing duration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ms'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  advice: { explicitBucketBoundaries: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paymentErrors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment.errors'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Payment error count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同时起草 Dashboard 的 JSON 模型（或 Grafana Dashboard-as-Code）——不是上线后再配，而是和代码一起进入 code review。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第四步-验证可观测性\">第四步：验证可观测性</h3><p>功能上线到 staging 后，不只跑功能测试，还要验证：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Trace 在 Tempo/Jaeger 中可见，span 结构符合设计</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> Metric 在 Prometheus/Mimir 中出现，histogram bucket 分布合理</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 结构化日志包含 trace_id，可从 trace 跳转</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 告警规则已部署，模拟错误后能触发</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"将-odd-嵌入团队流程\">将 ODD 嵌入团队流程</h2><p>ODD 不是额外负担——它应该融入现有的开发仪式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仪式</th>\n<th>ODD 嵌入点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>需求评审</strong></td>\n<td>PM 定义 SLI（用户视角的&quot;好&quot;是什么）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>技术设计</strong></td>\n<td>Span 结构 + Metric 定义写入设计文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Code Review</strong></td>\n<td>检查 span 是否有意义的 attribute、metric 是否覆盖关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>QA 验收</strong></td>\n<td>包含&quot;可观测性验收&quot;——trace/metric/log 都能在后端看到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>上线 Checklist</strong></td>\n<td>Dashboard + Alert Rule 已部署并验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-过度插桩\">反模式：过度插桩</h2><p>ODD 的风险是走向另一个极端——每个 if 分支都打 span、每个变量都打 attribute：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效信噪比</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>排障时实际用到的 span/attribute 数</mtext><mtext>总 span/attribute 数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效信噪比} = \\frac{\\text{排障时实际用到的 span/attribute 数}}{\\text{总 span/attribute 数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效信噪比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总</span><span class=\"mord\"> span/attribute </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">排障时实际用到的</span><span class=\"mord\"> span/attribute </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经验法则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Span 粒度</strong>：对应一次 I/O 操作（网络调用、磁盘读写、队列消费）或一个业务决策点，而非每行代码</li>\n<li><strong>Attribute 选择</strong>：只记录能用于<strong>分组</strong>或<strong>过滤</strong>的维度（如 <code>user.tier</code>、<code>region</code>），不记录高基数唯一值（如 <code>user.id</code>——那应该放日志）</li>\n<li><strong>Metric 基数</strong>：label 组合数应 &lt; 10,000，超过这个数字存储成本会爆炸</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"odd-与-feature-flag-的配合\">ODD 与 Feature Flag 的配合</h2><p>Feature Flag 是 ODD 的天然伙伴。新功能灰度发布时，在 span 上添加 <code>feature_flag.variant</code> 属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"span.setAttribute(&#39;feature_flag.key&#39;, &#39;new-checkout-flow&#39;);&#10;span.setAttribute(&#39;feature_flag.variant&#39;, flagClient.getVariant(&#39;new-checkout-flow&#39;, user));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'feature_flag.key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new-checkout-flow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'feature_flag.variant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, flagClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getVariant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new-checkout-flow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这让你能在 trace 和 metric 中按 flag 变体分组，直接对比新旧实现的延迟、错误率、转化率——可观测性成为灰度决策的数据基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组织成熟度信号\">组织成熟度信号</h2><p>团队是否真正实践 ODD，可以用以下信号衡量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成熟度等级</th>\n<th>信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 事后补救</td>\n<td>上线后发现没有 metric，临时加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 被动插桩</td>\n<td>依赖 auto-instrumentation，没有业务语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 主动设计</td>\n<td>设计文档包含 Span 结构，Code Review 检查可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 契约驱动</td>\n<td>SLI 在需求阶段定义，Dashboard 与代码同步部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 持续优化</td>\n<td>定期清理低价值 span/metric，信噪比作为技术债务跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于如何用 OTel SDK 实现上述插桩模式，参见 <a href=\"opentelemetry-adoption\">OpenTelemetry 落地实践</a>。SLI 的定义方法论与错误预算策略，参见 <a href=\"../backend-infra/service-level-objectives\">SLO 与错误预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>可观测性驱动开发把“上线后补监控”反转为“设计阶段定义可观测性契约”。它的四步流程是：定义契约、先写 Span 骨架、定义 Metric 与 Dashboard、验证可观测性——这四步与代码一同进入 code review。ODD 不是额外负担，而是嵌入需求评审、技术设计、QA 验收等现有仪式的检查项。要警惕走向另一个极端：过度插桩会稀释信噪比，经验法则是 span 对应一次 I/O 或业务决策点，attribute 只记录可用于分组/过滤的低基数维度。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性驱动开发","id":"可观测性驱动开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ODD 与相邻实践的关系","id":"odd-与相邻实践的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"ODD 的四步流程","id":"odd-的四步流程"},{"level":3,"text":"第一步：定义可观测性契约","id":"第一步-定义可观测性契约"},{"level":3,"text":"第二步：先写 Span 骨架","id":"第二步-先写-span-骨架"},{"level":3,"text":"第三步：定义 Metric 与 Dashboard","id":"第三步-定义-metric-与-dashboard"},{"level":3,"text":"第四步：验证可观测性","id":"第四步-验证可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"将 ODD 嵌入团队流程","id":"将-odd-嵌入团队流程"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：过度插桩","id":"反模式-过度插桩"},{"level":2,"text":"ODD 与 Feature Flag 的配合","id":"odd-与-feature-flag-的配合"},{"level":2,"text":"组织成熟度信号","id":"组织成熟度信号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenTelemetry 落地实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/foundations/opentelemetry-adoption"},"next":{"title":"真实用户监控（RUM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/real-user-monitoring"}}